      "statement": "The release-please-managed manifest records independent current release baselines: libs/deepagents 0.7.13, libs/acp 0.0.11, libs/code 0.1.66, libs/talon 0.0.6, daytona 0.0.8, modal 0.0.6, runloop 0.0.7, vercel 0.0.2, and quickjs 0.3.7.",
