      "id": "claim_7d5127d4121c47cabf67b4a2162ad40d",
      "statement": "When a release-please PR is merged, release-please detects the release title plus the component CHANGELOG.md change and dispatches the package release workflow; that workflow builds, runs pre-release validation, publishes to Test PyPI and then PyPI, and creates the GitHub release.",
