    {
      "id": "claim_549bbc7258be4b019381fbca237dec29",
      "statement": "Before release-please recomputes release PRs, the workflow waits for every merged PR still labeled autorelease: pending; this avoids evaluating a manifest that has advanced while the corresponding tag has not yet been created, and unreadable release state fails closed.",
